  "permissions": ["activeTab"],
  "background": {
    "script": "bg/background.js"
  },
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": ["content_scripts/content_script.js"]
    }
  ]
}
```
Replace the placeholders with appropriate values. The `matches` property in `content_scripts` can be set to match specific URLs or use the wildcard `<all_urls>` to apply to all websites.

4. In the `background.js` file, write the code to listen for a message from the content script and then execute the desired JavaScript code on the active tab. For example:

